{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794868656677,"sessionID":"ses_e1984dae6ffeaD8lGAJ4oqvNMo","part":{"partID":"prt_1e681ff03001GPjiOTKfCM1UWI","sessionID":"ses_e1984dae6ffeaD8lGAJ4oqvNMo","messageID":"msg_1e681eb14001rmj7O5gNnV7gs3","type":"tool","id":"call_272e6f8bbd5a4d7db268f5f9","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - command surfacing pass fourteen (mention area)\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for the `mention-14` fan-out lineage. It records dimension coverage, findings, what worked and failed, and the next focus across iterations.\n\n### Usage\n\nRead before each iteration; updated after each iteration. Writable sections are edited in place by the reviewer; machine-owned blocks are refreshed by the reducer.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass fourteen of command surfacing, area `mention`:\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`\n\nDiff base `932aff4e437`, head `e626653ce79`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The `data` area of pass fourteen (advisor intent signals, ADR-001) belongs to `data-14`.\n- The recorded limits in `review-brief-14.txt` line 10 are not re-reported without a new input.\n- No code changes are made; this is an observation-only review.\n- Holdout corpora are never opened (holdout rule in the brief).\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence threshold `0.1` under `stopPolicy: convergence`, or `maxIterations: 8` reached.\n- An iteration over budget or a failed gateway append halts with an honest non-`complete` status.\n- `convergence.cjs --stop-decision` is the only stop authority; its `blockedBy` steers the next iteration.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated, with evidence]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Files: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\n- Why: pass thirteen changed the pronoun-refusal rule and moved the document-naming rule; both directions of misreading (request-as-mention and refusal-as-request) need a first pass.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `commandOnlyMentioned` (`command-attach.ts:442`), `COMMAND_DECLINED_BY_PRONOUN` (`command-attach.ts:415`), `COMMAND_AS_DOCUMENT` (`command-attach.ts:423`), and the guard suite `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`.\n- Behavior claims in the reviewed diff: a `do not run it` refusal must end its clause (only `yet`, `now`, `for now`, `at all`, `please` may follow), and a document naming followed by `then` is not only a read.\n- Reuse and conventions: `commandOnlyMentioned` returns true for a mention; `attachCommand` withholds the command when the guard returns true. `COMMAND_USE_VERB`, `COMMAND_OR_LIST` and `COMMAND_DECLINE_LEADS` are shared vocabulary.\n- Review risks and gaps: the working tree matches `e626653ce79` for both scope files; no other pass-fourteen file is read. `data-14` owns the advisor signals and ADR-001.\n- Out of scope: every other file, including the corpus and holdout files named by the holdout rule.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | not a skill/agent definition change |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no agent mirror touched by this diff |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no feature catalog row in scope |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no playbook capability in scope |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | [] | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | [] | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-mention-14-1794868189353-tsxtos, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T22:37:01Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-14/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-14/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-14/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - command surfacing pass fourteen (mention area)\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for the `mention-14` fan-out lineage. It records dimension coverage, findings, what worked and failed, and the next focus across iterations.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\nRead before each iteration; updated after each iteration. Writable sections are edited in place by the reviewer; machine-owned blocks are refreshed by the reducer.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass fourteen of command surfacing, area `mention`:\\n\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`\\n\\nDiff base `932aff4e437`, head `e626653ce79`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The `data` area of pass fourteen (advisor intent signals, ADR-001) belongs to `data-14`.\\n- The recorded limits in `review-brief-14.txt` line 10 are not re-reported without a new input.\\n- No code changes are made; this is an observation-only review.\\n- Holdout corpora are never opened (holdout rule in the brief).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence threshold `0.1` under `stopPolicy: convergence`, or `maxIterations: 8` reached.\\n- An iteration over budget or a failed gateway append halts with an honest non-`complete` status.\\n- `convergence.cjs --stop-decision` is the only stop authority; its `blockedBy` steers the next iteration.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Review angles investigated and eliminated, with evidence]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Files: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts`\\n- Why: pass thirteen changed the pronoun-refusal rule and moved the document-naming rule; both directions of misreading (request-as-mention and refusal-as-request) need a first pass.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `commandOnlyMentioned` (`command-attach.ts:442`), `COMMAND_DECLINED_BY_PRONOUN` (`command-attach.ts:415`), `COMMAND_AS_DOCUMENT` (`command-attach.ts:423`), and the guard suite `command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`.\\n- Behavior claims in the reviewed diff: a `do not run it` refusal must end its clause (only `yet`, `now`, `for now`, `at all`, `please` may follow), and a document naming followed by `then` is not only a read.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `commandOnlyMentioned` returns true for a mention; `attachCommand` withholds the command when the guard returns true. `COMMAND_USE_VERB`, `COMMAND_OR_LIST` and `COMMAND_DECLINE_LEADS` are shared vocabulary.\\n- Review risks and gaps: the working tree matches `e626653ce79` for both scope files; no other pass-fourteen file is read. `data-14` owns the advisor signals and ADR-001.\\n- Out of scope: every other file, including the corpus and holdout files named by the holdout rule.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | not a skill/agent definition change |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no agent mirror touched by this diff |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no feature catalog row in scope |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | no playbook capability in scope |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | [] | - | - | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | [] | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-mention-14-1794868189353-tsxtos, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T22:37:01Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-14/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794868641539,"end":1794868656677}}}}
