lved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"correctness - the new tail refusal and document rules, the widened occurrence boundary and the typed start boundary\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:1-566\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:197-245\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:359-476\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:1-615\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:138-320\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:509-597\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:1200-1216\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-brief-13.txt:1-10\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-scope-13.txt:1-6\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/spec.md:40-202\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/tasks.md:37-46,130-131\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/040-final-alignment-loop/acceptance-criteria.md:56\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/native-cli-tools/command-offer-fit-gates.md:3-123\"],\"findingsCount\":4,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":2,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":2,\"P2\":2},\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"F001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"A document naming returns a mention before a later request clause is read\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:458\",\"evidence\":\"COMMAND_AS_DOCUMENT returns true from commandOnlyMentioned on the document noun alone, before the COMMAND_ASKED_BY_PRONOUN check at line 460. \\\"open the /deep:review command file, then run it\\\" reads as a mention and typedCommandForTop returns undefined; attachCommand(\\\"system-deep-loop\\\", SINGLE(\\\"review\\\"), \\\"read the /deep:review docs, then do a thorough review of this diff\\\") returns undefined although DEPTH_REQUEST matches \\\"thorough\\\". The contract at lines 403-407 says a use-verb clause with \\\"it\\\" turns an earlier naming into a request.\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"findingClass\":\"logic-ordering\",\"scopeProof\":\"Ran the exported guards and consumer on two concrete prompts; both classify as mentions. The old tree had no document return and the unchanged pronoun regex matches the tail \\\"command file, then run it\\\", so the earlier read was a request. REQUEST6 and CONTROL5 carry no document naming, which is why the suite stays green.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\".skilled/skills/s"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-13 && head -1 deltas/iter-001.jsonl | head -c 3000\"}"},"time":{"start":1794869057395,"end":1794869058112}}}}
